21237989,2026-04-14,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Credit card company isn't resolving a dispute about a purchase on your statement,"I am submitting this complaint regarding XXXX XXXX XXXX denial of my claim for an unauthorized credit card transaction in the amount of {$3000.00} on XX/XX/2025. 

I did not authorize a {$3000.00} transaction. I was the victim of a fraud in which individuals represented that they were collecting a small charitable donation. I agreed to a limited donation ( {$20.00} ) and briefly provided my card and phone for that purpose only. The {$3000.00} transaction significantly exceeded the scope of my consent and was induced by misrepresentation.

XXXX  denied my claim on the basis that this was a "" scam '' rather than a fraud, citing that the transaction was card-present and authenticated via SMS. This justification was communicated to me over the phone by the Company 's Customer Protection Services team. The Company 's explanation improperly equates authentication with authorization. Any verification that occurred was obtained under false pretenses and does not constitute knowing authorization of a {$3000.00} charge. 

