21506615,2026-04-22,Debt collection,Credit card debt,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive enough information to verify debt,"PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ACCT # XXXX I am writing to formally dispute the validity, accuracy, and completeness of the alleged account you are reporting and/or attempting to collect.

