21528740,2026-04-23,Debt collection,Credit card debt,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive enough information to verify debt,"I am submitting this complaint against Zwicker & Associates, P.C., acting on behalf of XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, regarding continued collection and litigation activity on a disputed debt without adequate substantiation of personal liability.

