21553593,2026-04-24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Closing your account,Company closed your account,"I am filing this complaint regarding my Capital One Venture X credit card account, which was unexpectedly restricted and subsequently closed without any prior notice or explanation.

At Capital Ones request, I promptly submitted my drivers license and completed identity verification using the secure link they provided. I have followed up multiple times and re-uploaded the required documents as instructed. I also confirmed with customer service representatives that my documents were successfully submitted.

Despite my compliance, I never received any communication from Capital One regarding the status of my account. I did not receive any phone calls, emails, letters, or voicemail messages informing me of any issues, concerns, or the decision to close my account.

To my shock, I later discovered that my account had been closed without notice. Additionally, all of my accumulated rewards points were removed without my knowledge or consent. I had been saving these points for travel, and losing them without explanation has caused significant frustration and stress.

I made repeated attempts to contact Capital One customer service for clarification and resolution. However, I have not received any meaningful response or assistance. No one has been able to explain why my account required verification initially, nor why it was ultimately closed despite my full cooperation.

This situation has caused unnecessary stress and financial inconvenience, especially given the value of the rewards points that were removed.

I respectfully request the following : 1. A clear explanation for why my account was restricted and closed.

2. Immediate review of my account and verification documents.

3. Reinstatement of my account, if possible.

4. Restoration of all rewards points that were removed.

I have made every effort to comply with Capital Ones requests and have acted in good faith throughout this process. I am requesting a fair and timely resolution to this matter.",,CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION,NY,11222,,Web,2026-04-24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes
