21766413,2026-04-30,Mortgage,Home equity loan or line of credit (HELOC),Closing on a mortgage,Changes in loan terms during or after closing,"I am a contractor operating under XXXX XXXX. My company was engaged by the lender to provide a quote and perform work for a homeowner in connection with a loan being processed.

